  "body_text": "紧锣密鼓的一天\n‍\n‍\n基地马上大变样\n评审团队们还在忙碌着做赛前最后的的烘焙、测试、矫正等准备工作\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n作为编外人士，俺今天拉着表叔把晒的豆子都抬上二楼安顿好\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n发了第一批这一产季的实验批次回去\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n明天开始，摸鱼咯！\n蓝天、白云～好日子～好事\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n2025第一批豆子～要来咯！",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          紧锣密鼓的一天\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          基地马上大变样\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          评审团队们还在忙碌着做赛前最后的的烘焙、测试、矫正等准备工作\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          作为编外人士，俺今天拉着表叔把晒的豆子都抬上二楼安顿好\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          发了第一批这一产季的实验批次回去\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          明天开始，摸鱼咯！\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXicOc8c8QUCfUn3ia5UX5ESVTIsEm3FXIBXybowtjfT1rbJMmgOXIW1mF27GUDjzoiaibmQpWcUbjog/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bo